        <description>Field to designate a commissionable product category on opportunity products so credit can be given towards design win quota upon manager approval.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>If this is a Design Oppty type, select the product category for the product.  If this is a Deal Oppty, product categories will be based on the Product Type field which is auto-populated and will be grouped into the appropriate product categories for you.</inlineHelpText>
